{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/d1791fd34fc968317be87c42e9cacfe2.avif?t=1761619895\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From wilderness to civilization. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every choice you make reshapes your lineage\u2014and, in time, the course of society.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Legacy of Ancestors, you set out from the wilds, cross from antiquity to the modern day, <br>and live through nine reincarnations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each year\u2019s draw-and-decide cards, each relationship you nurture, rewrites your family\u2019s path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/be98c640db7733f3307acd3ae31d440c.avif?t=1761619895\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft your identity. Body type, hair, and outfits are all customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Starting Traits and eight core Attributes combine into <br>a unique opening build that quietly tilts early encounters and social outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.poster.avif?t=1761619895\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.webm?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/f1b444fc4ad423a5249edce56bce15b6.mp4?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/9e6118b67553b8cdcf803207bd9e12e7.avif?t=1761619895\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the first campfire spark to today\u2019s neon, those intimate moments<br>\u2014brave confessions, brief hesitations, wordless silences\u2014are inscribed in the Book of Fate, quietly bending the year ahead and even the journey after rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.poster.avif?t=1761619895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.webm?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51026c2b3005986eda3f5375869380b8.mp4?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/1d3d773f0bfcabf2cab67b1bef4363f4.avif?t=1761619895\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lovers, children, and heirs are bound by golden bloodlines and bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choosing an heir isn\u2019t just passing a torch; <br>it\u2019s a strategic redistribution of your resources, renown, and talents\u2014setting the prologue for your next chapter.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/dada55e0512273a63cb4c542a18d15c3.avif?t=1761619895\" width=1466 height=1077 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/c0d0c0a4bb458b72fc060b00f27b588b.avif?t=1761619895\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Years \u2192 Death \u2192 Meng Po\u2019s Soup (draught of forgetfulness) \u2192 Rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With inheritance, you carry your house\u2019s momentum forward; <br>without it, you return as a \u201cNameless\u201d\u2014a clean slate at the starting line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.poster.avif?t=1761619895\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.webm?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/extras/51735327338358f43405279d42c85ed2.mp4?t=1761619895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>Early Access (EA): targeted before the end of 2025 (rolling completion of the three-stage storyline; all 18 romanceable NPC routes open).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0: during EA we\u2019ll iterate on balance, events, and presentation based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer, actively collecting feedback\u2014see community channels below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community &amp; Feedback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 1045014397 (bugs &amp; suggestions)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu: 6217732645 (dev logs, same handle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X (Twitter): </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous iteration from Demo \u2192 EA \u2192 1.0. Priorities: balance, event-trigger stability, and localization quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a one-person project\u2014and a responsive one. Your feedback across Demo, EA, and release will be actively incorporated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing and reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding AI-Assisted Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some visuals and audio elements in this game were <strong>generated using AI tools</strong>, including cover artwork, UI assets, and background music.<br>All generated content has been <strong>curated and polished</strong> to maintain artistic consistency and quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development prioritizes <strong>gameplay and system stability</strong> first. Based on player feedback, we will continue to refine related assets in future updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585420?t=1761619895","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585420?t=1761619895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/f295121ff707700835ea88ac145b2b8fba7f7649/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761619895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585420/f295121ff707700835ea88ac145b2b8fba7f7649/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761619895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alter